graph TD
    A[Transcription Initiation Complete] --> B[Promoter Clearance]
    B --> C[RNA Polymerase II Phosphorylation]
    C --> D[Elongation Factor Recruitment]
    D --> E[Transcription Elongation]
    E --> F[Nucleotide Addition]
    F --> G[RNA Chain Extension]
    G --> H{Termination Signal?}
    H -->|No| I[Continue Elongation]
    I --> F
    
    H -->|Yes| J[Termination Factor Binding]
    J --> K[RNA Polymerase II Release]
    K --> L[Transcription Termination]
    L --> M[Transcription Elongation Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    E --> N[Pausing Factor]
    N --> O[Transcription Pause]
    O --> P{Resume Elongation?}
    P -->|Yes| Q[Elongation Resumption]
    Q --> F
    P -->|No| R[Transcription Arrest]
    
    %% Regulation
    M --> S[Transcription Status]
    S --> T{Elongation Required?}
    T -->|Yes| U[Elongation Activation]
    T -->|No| V[Elongation Inhibition]
    
    %% Key proteins
    W[RNA Polymerase II] --> C
    X[Elongation Factors] --> D
    Y[Pausing Factors] --> N
    Z[Termination Factors] --> J
    AA[CTD Kinases] --> C
    BB[CTD Phosphatases] --> M
    
    %% Styling
    style A fill:#c8e6c9
    style B fill:#f4a261
